WEBVTT

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.360
"Honjo"

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.650
One, please!

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.530
That's 500 yen!

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.030
Two for me, please!

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.950
Sure! 1,000 yen!

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.210
Looks like it's not even a contest.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.340
I wouldn't be so sure about that.
Girls, get ready!

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.750
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.680
Wha--?!

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:40.010
We made these outfits while
you guys worked on the manga!

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.350
We'll do whatever it takes to win!

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:16.990
"Shido A Live"

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:20.950
Circle "Ratatoskr" here!
Please line up to buy your copy!

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:24.490
That circle's got a bunch of cute girls.

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:27.160
They're not in the catalog.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.710
Hmm? What have we got here?

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.210
Ooh! Thank you!

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:35.130
--Huh? No, I...
--That's 500 yen, please!

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:38.010
Uh, right... I'll take it.

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.880
Whoa! Thank you!

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.390
S-Sure.

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:45.010
I guess that works, too.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.650
"Line Starts Here"

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:50.020
The line starts here!

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.900
Request! Please form two lines!

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:55.650
It got busy all of a sudden.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:57.070
Two, please.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.990
S-Sure! Wait, huh?!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:06.240
Yup. It's the Ratatoskr crew.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.330
So we're using shills now?

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.580
Hey, Tohka! We made it!

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.380
This place is packed!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.000
That's so lame.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.710
Mm! Thanks for coming, guys!

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:21.470
You know it! Since you asked,
I had to come!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.850
Mm-hmm! Comico sounded fun, too.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:29.180
Hmm? Even Itsuka's here!
You helping Tohka?

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.730
Y-Yeah.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:37.270
Hmm? I feel like the protagonist
looks awfully like Itsuka.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.940
That's so lame.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:45.780
U-Um, but it's fiction! Any similarity
to real people or events is coincidental!

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.790
Thanks, Captain Obvious.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.750
Spirits? A secret organization?

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.500
That's so lame.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:03.510
Origami? It's rare for you to ask a favor.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:08.010
Captain, Mikie, Mildred...
Thanks for coming.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:12.600
Hey, I feel like I've
seen those girls before...

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.270
You haven't.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:18.020
You seem different lately, Origami.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.480
I'm not.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.820
Those people...

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:26.700
They don't remember the world
before I changed history?

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:34.120
No, but we Spirits remember 'cuz we're
connected to you through Spirit power.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.170
Five boxes left... And her?

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.340
It's no use! We'll never win!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:51.350
Of course not. These people want
one thing--a good read.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:57.770
You stood no chance against me in such
short a time, even with your tricks.

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:02.780
It's not over yet!
We're just getting started!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:03.940
Hmm?

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.870
"Miku here~ I'm at Comico doing
a handshake event at Ratatoskr
(West A-20/5). Take a photo with me~~~! #comico"

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.450
It's showtime!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:14.500
"Submit"

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.790
It's actually her!

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.170
No way! Why is she here?!

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.720
Can we really shake your hand?!

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:30.680
Thanks for all your support,
everyone! I-It's true!

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:34.310
Miku, are you sure?

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.730
But you hate men!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:43.070
Darling and everyone else gave their best,
so I refuse to stand by!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:48.660
I'm stepping up like Natsumi!
I wanna do my part, too!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.120
Thank you!

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:55.750
Hmm? Not bad. That girl's famous, huh?

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.920
Yeah. She's our treasured idol.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.300
But can you catch up?

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:08.800
Yeah, we'll win. Not only for
our sake, but for yours, too.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.260
Listen to you!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.980
Maybe. Only if you win, though.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.560
Honjo?

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.440
Um...

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.910
T-Takajo...

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:34.080
It's been a while.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:39.210
I had to come when I heard
you were participating.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:42.170
U-Uh...

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:45.250
Kotori, did you know she'd come?

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.590
No.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:51.590
I'm sorry to bother you,
but there's something I have to ask.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:56.100
Have I done something to upset you
without knowing it?

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:59.520
If so, I'd like to apologize.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.480
Th-That's not...

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:06.730
Though, even if you hate me,

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:11.320
I'll always look forward
to reading your works.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.660
Mm...

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.330
I finally get it.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:24.500
You like her, don't you?

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.250
Huh?! Wh-What are you saying, Boy?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:31.930
You didn't distance yourself
'cuz you found out her dark side.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:36.890
You're just afraid you'll get curious
and look someday...

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.770
That you'll learn about her dark side.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:45.360
You pulled away,
afraid to be let down, right?

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:49.360
Hah! You don't know what
you're talking about, Boy!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.740
Five hundred yen, please!

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:53.610
Then explain yourself!

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:57.240
For hating people,
you sure get along with 'em!

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:00.410
Would you shut up?
Focus on your booth!

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.960
Two, right?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:05.540
--Sorry, but no can do!
--Hey, Shido! Help out!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:11.720
I wanna win 'cuz I wanna help you!
Ignoring the problem ain't gonna help!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.470
Here's your change!

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.680
So what if I'm afraid?!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:21.600
As if someone who can peep into
people's lives could make friends!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.140
You won't know till you try!

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:28.770
Would you open your heart
to someone who can peep into

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:31.900
all your dark secrets and private life?!

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:36.370
I can see you on the toilet or
in the bath around the clock!

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:39.200
No one will be my friend knowing that!

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.330
Wh-What's so funny?!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.580
Sorry, but that doesn't even faze me.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.290
"Line Starts Here"

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:50.130
Privacy? What's that?

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:53.170
In fact, you're a saint for even caring.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.010
Huh?

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:58.720
If you wanna peep on me, go ahead!
I'm never gonna hate you for it!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.640
We're down to one copy!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.890
Shido, it's our last one!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:06.440
--Thank you!
--Thank you!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.020
Ratatoskr: sold out!

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.860
Honjo: sold out!

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:16.110
Now then, it seems we had a tie.

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:22.950
Ah, fine. Since you guys
put up a fight, I'll read it.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:31.000
Ugh, good grief.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.090
Hmm? I see...

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:33.630
"Shido A Live"

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:38.800
A tale about Shido Itsuka
saving Spirits...

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:43.020
It's better than I thought
it would be, but still...

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.600
It just packs too much in.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:51.770
With eight Spirits, there're not enough
pages to like the main character.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:56.150
Well, it's not bad
considering the time crunch.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.740
How did they even make it in time?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:08.580
I wanna show that dummy Nia, too:
That friends are a wonderful thing.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:23.100
The whole story was true?
Even the things he said...

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.820
Nia...

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.950
What did you think of our manga?

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.740
Hmm. It's all right,

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:46.750
but it's a bit naïve to think
I'd fall for you with just that.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:54.210
Still, since it moved me a little,

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.090
I'm fine with giving you another shot.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.170
--Huh?
--For crying out loud!

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.680
I'll go on another date!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.430
If you're a man, make it count!

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.690
--Shido!
--Awesome!

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.440
You did it, Darling!

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.530
It's still too early to celebrate.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.110
But, Boy--

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.620
N-Nia?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.750
The spatial quake alarm!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.500
Nia! What's wrong?!

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.260
Reine, what's happening?!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:43.300
Spirit Level: Category E! Nia's inverting!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:25.050
Spatial quake warning. Please evacuate
to the nearest shelter immediately.

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:29.060
Just as planned: Sister inverted.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.600
But why, Ike?

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.390
For five years,

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:38.900
we put Sister through
unthinkable physical and mental agony.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.780
And yet, not once
could we make her invert.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:48.120
Before us, Sister had already
lost her faith in humanity.

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:51.620
That's why I allowed her to escape.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:56.750
So, the micro Realizer
you planted in her brain...

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:01.460
Was to make her forget
everything we did to her.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:07.640
But the instant she opened up to Shido
and regained her trust in humanity,

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.930
she remembered
five terrible years of suffering.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:17.730
It's just like glass--the higher the fall,
the easier it breaks.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:23.240
I'm counting on you, too.
Lend Ellen a hand.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.280
Beelzebub.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.500
--That's--!
--Careful, Shido!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.120
It's from her Demon King.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.930
Metatron!

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.270
Whatever this is, we can't let it be.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:06.030
Let us take care of these
while you get to Nia and--!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.780
Sorry, but I can't allow it.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:13.830
Ellen!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:19.040
Given your timing, I take it
you guys are responsible for this.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:24.420
Your Demon King's power is troublesome.
Let's finish this quickly.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:29.090
Sandalphon!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.560
Kaguya, Yuzuru, and Miku take Ellen!

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.430
Origami, Yoshino, and Natsumi help Shido!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.810
--Right!
--Right!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.060
Nia!

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:45.070
Wh-What's this? I can't move!

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.450
Future Entry!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.740
Leave it to me! Zadkiel!

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.660
You guys are in our way!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.750
Haniel!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.140
H-Huh?!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.940
Wh-What?!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.070
Future Entry again?!

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:31.410
Shido!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.250
Zadkiel!

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:43.710
Shido used Zadkiel!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:49.510
I can move?! Oh, I get it!
'Cuz that wasn't written down?

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:52.510
Now I can fight! Sandalphon!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.310
Nia!

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.810
Wait... If I use Miku's Gabriel...!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.820
Nia!

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.070
Shi... do...

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.910
Hang on! I'm gonna save you!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.120
I won't allow it.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.830
Nia!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:29.510
Why are you here, Artemisia Ashcroft?

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.300
Artemisia?!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.780
Isaac Westcott?!

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:54.450
Long time no see, Shido Itsuka.
I'm glad you're doing well.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:17:02.000
Ah, it's marvelous!
A crystal of inverted Spirit power--

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.540
Qlipha!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:11.050
At last, I take one great stride
towards my deepest desires!

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:32.030
No way! He absorbed a Sephirah?!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.950
That's right, Shido Itsuka.

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:40.410
Just like you gained
the powers of eight Spirits.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.950
Beelzebub.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:53.130
Oh, how curious.

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:59.550
Just by touching a Demon King,
you know exactly how to use its power.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.550
Ike!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:08.900
Ellen, behold one of the majestic
Demon Kings which shall light our path!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:14.900
But one is simply not enough
to satisfy our ambitions.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.160
Shido! You okay?!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.580
Yeah! But Nia was...!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:36.550
Ellen, we achieved our goal.
Let's call it a day.

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.010
Are you sure?

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:44.930
Even my body will struggle to absorb
multiple Demon Kings at once.

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:50.310
Besides, it would be such a waste
not to savor them one by one.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:57.700
We will meet again soon,
Shido Itsuka... and Spirits.

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:02.700
Someday, I'll make you invert
and take your Qlipha.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:06.500
Try to enjoy your final days of peace.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.380
Nia!

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:14.170
Nia! Nia! Hang in there!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:19.930
Wait, Shido! It's faint,
but I sense her Spirit power!

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:21.140
What?!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:26.680
Just before she was stabbed,
you pulled part of her consciousness back.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:31.350
At that point,
she wasn't fully inverted anymore.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:36.070
She probably has a fragment
of Sephirah left in her body.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:38.690
In other words, you can seal her.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:45.780
Please, Nia! Open your heart to me!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:50.080
I don't care if you use
all my power, so...

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:56.000
Open your eyes, Nia!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:04.470
--Nia!
--Nia!

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:05.930
Nia!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:14.610
You don't have to shout. I can hear you.

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:15.980
Nia!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.860
Thank... you...

00:21:58.420 --> 00:21:59.920
First sunrise of the year!

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:06.840
Boy... Thank you for everything.

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:11.220
Don't mention it.
Everyone's been helping me, too.

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.730
I had time to think while I recovered...

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:19.940
...and I wanna talk to Takajo again.

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:24.190
Yeah, you should.
She's a good person, probably.

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:25.440
"Probably"?

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:32.790
It's weird. It stinks that my power was
taken, but I'm kinda at peace with it.

00:22:32.790 --> 00:22:38.830
I had Raziel for, like, 30 years,
but maybe the power's too much for me.

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:43.710
Thirty years? You became
a Spirit that long ago?

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:49.390
It's 27 or 28 to be precise.
Don't I look good for my age?

00:22:49.390 --> 00:22:53.760
Your Spirit power probably
halted your aging.

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:57.520
But now, you'll age normally,
so watch out!

00:22:57.520 --> 00:23:02.770
Oh, by the way...
When did you guys become Spirits?

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:04.980
Five years ago for me.

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:07.400
I did about one year ago.

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:09.070
I did recently.

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:12.490
The rest of us are Pure Spirits.

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:14.580
"Pure Spirits"?

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:18.830
But Spirits were all humans
in the beginning, right?

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.000
"Episode 03:
'What's Yours Is Mine.'"

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:28.920
See the sky! See the stars! See Mukuro!

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:32.050
It's a new Spirit, floating in the cosmos!

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:34.180
Next time: "Space Spirit."

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:40.540
When Earth is in trouble,
Shido will rise! Shido will fight!

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:41.540
"Episode 04: 'Space Spirit.'"
